  "description": {
    "en": "Option recipes (research 2026-10-03 P8, R13, W-LOST). A modifier option gains an optional recipe, stored on the dish record as the top-level key optionBom {<option id>: [{supply, qty}]} -- never inside modifierGroups, so the public menu (which passes modifierGroups as stored) shows no recipe, and stock::bom_of (which reads the first \"bom\" array of a record) can never take an option's lines for the dish's. Old-image-safe: a dish without optionBom reserves exactly what it did, and clearing the last line removes the key. At placement each line's chosen options add one basket line {of, delta, bom} that joins the order's reservation, its later draw (consumed at PREPARING from the ledger's holds) and the all-or-nothing refusal check: 'extra salmon' 20 g reserves 20 g more. Lines name raw supplies, whole base units, at most 8 per option. Edited in the dish sheet (the 'Option recipes' section, admin/option-bom.js, sq/en/uk/ru) through GET/POST /api/owner/products/:id/option-bom.",
    "uk": "Техкарта опції: опція страви (напр. додатковий лосось 20 г) має власні рядки сировини, які резервуються і списуються разом зі стравою; гість рецепта не бачить, старі страви без змін."
  },
